# Declarative source for scripts/requirements.txt.
#
# Edit this file and regenerate the lockfile via:
#   uv pip compile scripts\requirements.in -o scripts\requirements.txt --generate-hashes
#
# Workflow: requirements.in is the human-edited source of truth (loose
# bounds); requirements.txt is the machine-generated lockfile (exact
# versions + SHA256 hashes for supply-chain integrity). Never edit
# requirements.txt by hand.

